<div class="loftrest" id="loftrest-{{ section.id }}">
<article class="lr-bg-white lr-pb-28">
    <div class="lr-max-w-3xl lr-mx-auto lr-px-4 lr-pt-10 md:lr-pt-16">

      <!-- HEADER -->
      <header>
        <p class="lr-text-brand-blue lr-font-bold lr-text-xs lr-uppercase lr-tracking-wide">The LoftRest™ Journal</p>
        <h1 class="lr-mt-3 lr-text-3xl md:lr-text-5xl lr-font-extrabold lr-text-brand-navy lr-tracking-tight lr-leading-tight">5 Reasons People Are Swapping Their Standard Pillows for This 3-in-1 Neck Relaxation Pillow</h1>
        <p class="lr-mt-4 lr-text-sm lr-text-slate-500">By the LoftRest™ team &middot; Updated September 2026</p>
      </header>

      <!-- IMAGE 1 (top): the end-of-day neck tension -->
      {%- if section.settings.image_top != blank -%}
      <figure class="lr-mt-8">
        {%- assign img = section.settings.image_top -%}{%- assign img_alt = img.alt | default: 'Man holding the back of his neck at the end of a long day' -%}{{ img | image_url: width: 1400 | image_tag: widths: '400, 600, 800, 1000, 1200, 1400', sizes: '(min-width: 768px) 720px, 100vw', class: 'lr-w-full lr-aspect-[4/3] lr-object-cover lr-object-[center_45%] lr-rounded-2xl', loading: 'eager', fetchpriority: 'high', alt: img_alt }}
        {%- if section.settings.caption_top != blank -%}<figcaption class="lr-mt-3 lr-text-sm lr-text-slate-500">{{ section.settings.caption_top | escape }}</figcaption>{%- endif -%}
      </figure>
      {%- endif -%}

      <!-- INTRO -->
      <div class="lr-mt-8 lr-space-y-4 lr-text-lg lr-text-slate-700 lr-leading-relaxed">
        <p>If your neck and shoulders feel tight by the end of the day, or you struggle to get comfortable on your pillow at night, you&rsquo;re not alone.</p>
        <p>Hours at a desk, heavy physical work and unsupportive pillows all take their toll. Plenty of people try pricey &ldquo;ergonomic&rdquo; pillows and still can&rsquo;t get comfortable.</p>
        <p>LoftRest™ takes a different approach: a short relaxation session before bed, followed by a contoured pillow you sleep on all night. Here&rsquo;s why people are making the switch.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- REASON 1 -->
      <section class="lr-mt-14">
        <div class="lr-flex lr-items-start lr-gap-4">
          <span class="lr-shrink-0 lr-w-10 lr-h-10 lr-rounded-full lr-bg-brand-navy lr-text-white lr-font-extrabold lr-flex lr-items-center lr-justify-center">1</span>
          <h2 class="lr-text-2xl md:lr-text-3xl lr-font-extrabold lr-text-brand-navy lr-tracking-tight">It combines 3 relaxation modes in one 15&ndash;30 minute session</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="lr-mt-5 lr-text-lg lr-text-slate-700 lr-leading-relaxed">Most at-home neck products do one thing: a foam stretcher <em>or</em> a heat pack. LoftRest™ runs three together, or one at a time:</p>
        <ul class="lr-mt-5 lr-space-y-3">
          <li class="lr-flex lr-gap-3 lr-rounded-xl lr-bg-brand-lightBlue/60 lr-p-4"><svg class="lr-w-5 lr-h-5 lr-shrink-0 lr-mt-0.5 lr-text-brand-blue" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" ><path d="M12.8 19.6A2 2 0 1 0 14 16H2" /><path d="M17.5 8a2.5 2.5 0 1 1 2 4H2" /><path d="M9.8 4.4A2 2 0 1 1 11 8H2" /></svg><span class="lr-text-slate-700"><strong class="lr-text-brand-navy">Pneumatic air traction.</strong> Built-in air chambers gently lift and lengthen the neck for a soothing stretch.</span></li>
          <li class="lr-flex lr-gap-3 lr-rounded-xl lr-bg-orange-50 lr-p-4"><svg class="lr-w-5 lr-h-5 lr-shrink-0 lr-mt-0.5 lr-text-brand-heat" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" ><path d="M12 3q1 4 4 6.5t3 5.5a1 1 0 0 1-14 0 5 5 0 0 1 1-3 1 1 0 0 0 5 0c0-2-1.5-3-1.5-5q0-2 2.5-4" /></svg><span class="lr-text-slate-700"><strong class="lr-text-brand-navy">Constant-temperature heat.</strong> Steady warmth helps tight neck and upper-shoulder muscles relax.</span></li>
          <li class="lr-flex lr-gap-3 lr-rounded-xl lr-bg-emerald-50 lr-p-4"><svg class="lr-w-5 lr-h-5 lr-shrink-0 lr-mt-0.5 lr-text-brand-emerald" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" ><path d="M22 12h-2.48a2 2 0 0 0-1.93 1.46l-2.35 8.36a.25.25 0 0 1-.48 0L9.24 2.18a.25.25 0 0 0-.48 0l-2.35 8.36A2 2 0 0 1 4.49 12H2" /></svg><span class="lr-text-slate-700"><strong class="lr-text-brand-navy">Micro-kinetic massage.</strong> Gentle massage modes work the muscles around your neck and the base of your skull, where tension often builds.</span></li>
        </ul>
        <p class="lr-mt-5 lr-text-lg lr-text-slate-700 lr-leading-relaxed">It&rsquo;s an easy way to unwind your neck at home, whenever you need it, with no appointments.</p>
      </section>

      <!-- REASON 2 -->
      <section class="lr-mt-14">
        <div class="lr-flex lr-items-start lr-gap-4">
          <span class="lr-shrink-0 lr-w-10 lr-h-10 lr-rounded-full lr-bg-brand-navy lr-text-white lr-font-extrabold lr-flex lr-items-center lr-justify-center">2</span>
          <h2 class="lr-text-2xl md:lr-text-3xl lr-font-extrabold lr-text-brand-navy lr-tracking-tight">It&rsquo;s made for long days at a desk or on the tools</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="lr-mt-5 lr-text-lg lr-text-slate-700 lr-leading-relaxed">Hours looking down at a screen, phone or workbench can leave your neck and shoulders feeling tight by the end of the day.</p>
        <div class="lr-mt-6 lr-grid lr-grid-cols-1 sm:lr-grid-cols-2 lr-gap-4">
          <div class="lr-rounded-2xl lr-border lr-border-slate-200 lr-p-5">
            <svg class="lr-w-6 lr-h-6 lr-text-brand-blue" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" ><path d="M18 5a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v8.526a2 2 0 0 0 .212.897l1.068 2.127a1 1 0 0 1-.9 1.45H3.62a1 1 0 0 1-.9-1.45l1.068-2.127A2 2 0 0 0 4 15.526V7a2 2 0 0 1 2-2z" /><path d="M20.054 15.987H3.946" /></svg>
            <h3 class="lr-mt-3 lr-font-bold lr-text-brand-navy">Desk workers</h3>
            <p class="lr-mt-1 lr-text-slate-600">Unwind after eight hours at a laptop.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="lr-rounded-2xl lr-border lr-border-slate-200 lr-p-5">
            <svg class="lr-w-6 lr-h-6 lr-text-brand-heat" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" ><path d="M10 10V5a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h2a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v5" /><path d="M14 6a6 6 0 0 1 6 6v3" /><path d="M4 15v-3a6 6 0 0 1 6-6" /><rect x="2" y="15" width="20" height="4" rx="1" /></svg>
            <h3 class="lr-mt-3 lr-font-bold lr-text-brand-navy">Physical workers</h3>
            <p class="lr-mt-1 lr-text-slate-600">Relax after lifting, overhead work and long shifts.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="lr-mt-6 lr-text-lg lr-text-slate-700 lr-leading-relaxed">LoftRest™ gives you a simple way to unwind: lie back, let the warmth, massage and gentle stretch relax you, then stay put and sleep on contoured memory foam.</p>
      </section>

      <!-- REASON 3 -->
      <section class="lr-mt-14">
        <div class="lr-flex lr-items-start lr-gap-4">
          <span class="lr-shrink-0 lr-w-10 lr-h-10 lr-rounded-full lr-bg-brand-navy lr-text-white lr-font-extrabold lr-flex lr-items-center lr-justify-center">3</span>
          <h2 class="lr-text-2xl md:lr-text-3xl lr-font-extrabold lr-text-brand-navy lr-tracking-tight">Dual-phase design: relax first, then sleep all night</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="lr-mt-5 lr-text-lg lr-text-slate-700 lr-leading-relaxed">The catch with most neck stretchers? You use them on the floor for ten minutes, then go back to a pillow that doesn&rsquo;t suit you. LoftRest™ works in two phases:</p>
        <div class="lr-mt-6 lr-grid lr-grid-cols-1 sm:lr-grid-cols-2 lr-gap-4">
