        <p class="lr-font-bold lr-text-brand-navy">Ready to try the dual-phase routine?</p>
        {%- if variant -%}<form action="{{ routes.cart_add_url }}" method="post" class="lr-contents"><input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{ variant.id }}"><input type="hidden" name="quantity" value="1"><input type="hidden" name="return_to" value="/checkout"><button type="submit" class="lr-mt-4 lr-inline-block lr-bg-brand-blue hover:lr-bg-sky-600 lr-text-white lr-font-extrabold lr-px-8 lr-py-4 lr-rounded-xl lr-shadow-lg lr-transition-colors">Check availability{% if on_sale %} &amp; save <span>{{ variant.compare_at_price | minus: variant.price | times: 100.0 | divided_by: variant.compare_at_price | round }}%</span>{% endif %}</button></form>{%- else -%}<a href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}" class="lr-mt-4 lr-inline-block lr-bg-brand-blue hover:lr-bg-sky-600 lr-text-white lr-font-extrabold lr-px-8 lr-py-4 lr-rounded-xl lr-shadow-lg lr-transition-colors">Check availability{% if on_sale %} &amp; save <span>{{ variant.compare_at_price | minus: variant.price | times: 100.0 | divided_by: variant.compare_at_price | round }}%</span>{% endif %}</a>{%- endif -%}
      </div>

      <!-- REASON 4 -->
      <section class="lr-mt-14">
        <div class="lr-flex lr-items-start lr-gap-4">
          <span class="lr-shrink-0 lr-w-10 lr-h-10 lr-rounded-full lr-bg-brand-navy lr-text-white lr-font-extrabold lr-flex lr-items-center lr-justify-center">4</span>
          <h2 class="lr-text-2xl md:lr-text-3xl lr-font-extrabold lr-text-brand-navy lr-tracking-tight">A built-in auto shut-off timer for worry-free sleep</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="lr-mt-5 lr-text-lg lr-text-slate-700 lr-leading-relaxed">If you&rsquo;ve ever dozed off with a heat pack or massager still running, you know the worry. LoftRest™ has a built-in automatic shut-off timer that powers down the heat, air traction and massage at the end of the session.</p>
        <p class="lr-mt-4 lr-text-lg lr-text-slate-700 lr-leading-relaxed">As you drift off, it simply becomes a supportive memory foam pillow, so you can stay on it until morning without getting up to switch pillows.</p>
      </section>

      <!-- REASON 5 -->
      <section class="lr-mt-14">
