        <p class="lr-mt-5 lr-text-lg lr-text-slate-700 lr-leading-relaxed">There&rsquo;s no bulky machine and no special setup. LoftRest™ runs on 5V USB, so it works with a USB wall adapter, a laptop or a power bank. Use it in bed, on the sofa, or take it with you when you travel.</p>
